<backdrop /><navbar title="照片识别与导入" back />
<view class="workspace"><text class="muted">选生活照可描述孩子在做什么；截图、报告或手写记录可提取文字。核对后再带到首页保存。</text><text class="error">{{error}}</text>
  <view class="panel surface"><picker range="{{modes}}" value="{{modeIndex}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="onMode"><view class="field-input">{{modes[modeIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><button class="btn btn-ghost" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="pick">选择照片或截图</button><image wx:if="{{image}}" class="scan-image" src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="preview" /><button wx:if="{{image}}" class="btn btn-primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="recognize">{{busy ? '正在看图识别…' : '识别这张图片'}}</button><text wx:if="{{!supported}}" class="muted">图片识别尚未启用；可先粘贴文字，核对后带入。</text><text class="muted">{{status}}</text></view>
  <view class="panel surface"><text class="heading">核对识别原文</text><text class="muted">日期、数字和手写字可能识别错误，请对照原图检查。超过500字请分段带入，原文不会被自动截断。</text><textarea class="field-input ocr-text" maxlength="-1" value="{{text}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindinput="onText" placeholder="识别结果会出现在这里，也可以粘贴已有文字" /><text class="{{text.length > 500 ? 'error' : 'muted'}}">{{text.length}} / 500</text>
    <view wx:if="{{image}}" class="row"><text>同时附上这张原图</text><switch checked="{{attach}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="onAttach" color="#096f60" /></view><button class="btn btn-primary" disabled="{{busy || !text || text.length > 500 || !canEdit}}" bindtap="bring">带到首页核对并分析</button><text class="muted">带入后不会自动保存。首页原有输入会保留到草稿箱。</text></view>
</view>
